WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,980
Do you think she is the only one who knows how to read entertainment news?

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,100
Will you listen to pop music?

3
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:08,820
I'll always watch movies and TV shows, right?

4
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,060
The billboards all over the street

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:16,050
It’s not like you haven’t seen the billboard and haven’t noticed the handsome guy.

6
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:18,210
Are you from Mars? What's wrong?

7
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:20,810
She is the most popular female star

8
00:00:20,810 --> 00:00:21,970
You don't even know her

9
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:23,650
It hurt her, you know?

10
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:25,050
Even if you really don’t know me

11
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:26,330
You also complimented me on how beautiful I am.

12
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:30,010
Are you so honest? You still laugh at handsome guys?

13
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:31,530
I have to tell you

14
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:36,230
You made me very unhappy today. I'm sorry.

15
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:37,950
I really don't watch much TV

16
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:39,550
So I don’t know any celebrities

17
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:41,310
I only know Andy Lau and Jacky Cheung.

18
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:47,580
No wonder he called you a bumpkin

19
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,420
You are so honest and cute

20
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:51,410
Others surround me

21
00:00:51,930 --> 00:01:05,460
The benefit on the face is just stepping on what the heck is it. Here is your menu. A bowl of chicken drumsticks.

22
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:10,620
What do you want to eat with a bowl of chicken legs?

23
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:13,590
Tell me and I will help you forever

24
00:01:13,790 --> 00:01:16,670
He probably doesn't know English. Thank you.

25
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:18,070
I'm ready myself
